[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/308719706","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/17531#issuecomment-308719706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/17531","id":308719706,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwODcxOTcwNg==","user":{"login":"csvn","id":8770194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzAxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8770194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn","html_url":"https://github.com/csvn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-06-15T12:47:47Z","updated_at":"2017-06-15T12:47:47Z","body":"Thought I could provide the more realistic usage scenario here. This is roughly what we are trying to do.\r\n\r\nA shared library for creating a chromed/shell app (common header, login, auth, etc) should provide the following:\r\n```typescript\r\n@NgModule({\r\n  exports: SHARED_STUFF,\r\n  imports: OWN_STUFF\r\n})\r\nexport class AppChromeLibraryModule {\r\n  static forRoot(wrappedRoutes: Routes, config?: ExtraOptions): ModuleWithProviders[] {\r\n    return [\r\n      RouterModule.forRoot(chromeRoutes(wrappedRoutes), config),\r\n      { ngModule: AppChromeLibraryModule, providers: CHROME_PROVIDERS }\r\n    ];\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis can then be used to create an app like this:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst routes: Routes = {\r\n  // routes for logged in users ...\r\n};\r\n\r\n@NgModule({\r\n  imports: [\r\n    AppChromeLibraryModule.forRoot(routes)\r\n  ]\r\n})\r\nexport class AppRoutingModule {}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/308719706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"csvn","id":8770194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzAxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8770194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn","html_url":"https://github.com/csvn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csvn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/308722031","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/17531#issuecomment-308722031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/17531","id":308722031,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwODcyMjAzMQ==","user":{"login":"Toxicable","id":13490925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDkwOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13490925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxicable","html_url":"https://github.com/Toxicable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxicable/followers